					],
					"visit": [
						"MYSTERY"
					]
				},
				"description": "{H5 Memorial Basic Exchange}\n\nAn exchange in memory of H5: swaps creatures of the nine original towns with H5 creatures of the same faction and level (levels 1-3). Basic creatures swap for basic creatures; upgraded creatures of the same line (original upgrades, the two H5 upgrades, and upgrades from the Tides of War and Third Upgrades mods) can be swapped freely among one another. Shrunk and Downgraded troops (levels 1-3) can be restored to their original form here. Free, with unlimited visits; you pay the difference only when exchanging into the more expensive Tides of War or Third Upgrades forms (or from them into a more expensive form), in batches by count (1, several or dozens at a time). Only one creature type is exchanged at a time; to exchange another, press Space to visit again.",
				"visitMode": "unlimited",
				"selectMode": "selectPlayer",
				"canRefuse": true,
				"onSelectMessage": "{H5 Memorial Basic Exchange}\n\nPick an icon: each icon shows the creature you will get, and all matching troops in your army will be exchanged into it. Only one creature type is exchanged at a time; to exchange another, press Space to visit again. You can exchange creatures of the nine original towns with level 1-3 H5 creatures of the same faction (basic for basic, and upgraded creatures freely among one another), and Shrunk and Downgraded troops can be restored to their original form. Free, with unlimited visits; exchanging into the more expensive Tides of War or Third Upgrades forms costs the difference per creature.",
				"onEmptyMessage": "{H5 Memorial Basic Exchange}\n\nYou have no troops that can be exchanged here: this place only swaps creatures of the nine original towns with level 1-3 H5 creatures of the same faction, and restores Shrunk and Downgraded troops to their original form (levels 1-3).",
